# Documentation and runbooks must NOT ship inside the internet-facing image.
# Several of these map the homelab (Proxmox host IP, SSH key, firewall topology)
# and would aid lateral movement if the container were ever compromised. The
# server serves public/ only and imports no markdown at runtime, so excluding
# every doc is safe. LICENSE / ASSETS-LICENSE (no extension) still ship.
*.md
**/*.md
*.pdf
# PM staging artifacts that must never reach a built image.
DESIGN-*.html
_worker-notes
